        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bill Cassidy, David Vitter, John Bel Edwards\n- Roles: U.S. senator, Louisiana senior senator, Republican lobbyist, lawyer, politician\n- Legislation: Patient Freedom Act of 2017\n\nFacts:\n- Bill Cassidy was one of the senators who proposed the Patient Freedom Act of 2017.\n- In 2017, Bill Cassidy replaced Louisiana's senior senator.\n- The replaced Louisiana senior senator was David Vitter.\n- David Vitter is a Republican lobbyist, lawyer, and politician.\n- John Bel Edwards once defeated David Vitter.",
